 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9uJWMjDdsW4Q7kNvwFAjdTO&_nc_oc=AdqDFHjpnA_mSBdFRfDYm9vZGehtSTS6DREHLOEnh9jwUCgjQI0dD4N3_g6MNMZJy_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI09B7dW0rj6NwS3rjqyH5cH6gQw9imLsNprCJ24ekqrg&oe=6AAEA8B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ThScSUiWARcQ7kNvwF7-qjB&_nc_oc=AdrGIWPtgDiZClLcs96GATfPf7MfJfEQW7iC9eZS311FKYYtgcufhmjaGD_5_KFtyZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJr0Bmc8JkqCFl01WYEgp6mcuGxDSmVyMxSQevNeVuU2g&oe=6AAEAA16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2WZr-ZnrJbEQ7kNvwH0Xweo&_nc_oc=AdqmGD2qGoKquDP1JxcKB68TU0zN_kXVesYABZtaElD0gLoFCDXJhygu4u7siZ4oXd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJudx_Mv3VDmJs_Os-gc3kXJ_kazAd-rVCPGcLA0VOyww&oe=6AAE86F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "